{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.lp_dual_stability","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.lp_dual_stability","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Fin"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.lp_dual_stability","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.lp_dual_stability","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L78-L94","doc":"**LP dual stability of confined hadrons** ([`prop:lp-dual-stability`]).\n\nThe four-part claim: (i) primal stability `G x* ≥ 0`, (ii) bounded\ndual prices `|y*ᵢ| ≤ κ(G)·‖t‖`, (iii) the partial-confinement\nsub-braid is LP-unstable (`σ₀` channel of `G x_partial` is negative),\n(iv) strong duality `tr_M(x*) = y₀* · n_target`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:lp-dual-stability","label":"prop:lp-dual-stability","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-dual-stability.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.strong_duality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.strong_duality","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L76-L76","doc":"Strong duality holds.\n(Needs abstract LP duality infrastructure that does not exist in Mathlib; kept as an honest assumption for models without certificates) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.partial_unstable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.partial_unstable","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L73-L73","doc":"Partial-confinement sub-braid is LP-unstable. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.dual_price_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.dual_price_bound","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Dual shadow prices are bounded. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.primal_stable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.primal_stable","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L69-L69","doc":"Primal stability holds in all channels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.σ_0_idx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.σ_0_idx","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L67-L67","doc":"The `σ₀` channel index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.x_partial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.x_partial","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L65-L65","doc":"The partial-confinement primal vector `x_partial : Fin channels → ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.x_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.x_star","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The confined primal solution `x* : Fin channels → ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.n_target","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.n_target","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L61-L61","doc":"The target nucleon count `n_target : ℕ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.y_0_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.y_0_star","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The net-constraint dual variable `y₀* : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.tr_M_x_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.tr_M_x_star","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The total Markov trace `tr_M(x*) : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.t_norm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.t_norm","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The Euclidean norm `‖t‖`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.t","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The mass-coefficient (cost) vector `t : Fin channels → ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.y_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.y_star","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The dual shadow prices `y* : Fin channels → ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.κ_G","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.κ_G","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The condition number `κ(G)` of the Gram matrix (`≈ 7.0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.G","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.G","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The Frobenius Gram matrix `G : Fin channels → Fin channels → ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.channels","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.channels","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The number of LP channels (6 for the standard QOU `H₃(q)` NF basis). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.q","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L43-L43","doc":"Substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LpDualStabilityContext","kind":"class","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/lp_dual_stability.lean#L39-L76","doc":"Data of the confined-hadron LP-stability claim. All fields are\n*inputs*; none asserts a conclusion. ","signatureChunk":0}]}